    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "eKPM (UE별 보안 텔레메트리를 초당 건수로 집계)",
      "description": "eKPM은 UE별 메시지·상태 변화라, 시간 구간마다 센 값(초당)으로 그린다. 어느 UE인지는 아래 이벤트·근거 표에서 본다",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "influxdb",
        "uid": "portran-influxdb"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "interval": "1s",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "influxdb",
            "uid": "portran-influxdb"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "query": "base = from(bucket: v.defaultBucket)\n  |> range(start: v.timeRangeStart, stop: v.timeRangeStop)\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => r._measurement == \"metric\" and r._field == \"value\" and r.kind == \"ekpm\")\n  |> filter(fn: (r) => contains(value: r.node, set: ${node:json}))\nper_second = (tables=<-, label) => tables\n  |> group()\n  |> aggregateWindow(every: v.windowPeriod, fn: count, createEmpty: true)\n  |> map(fn: (r) => ({_time: r._time, _field: label, _value: float(v: r._value) / (float(v: int(v: v.windowPeriod)) / 1000000000.0)}))\n// 코드값은 schema/SCHEMA.md 6.3절 (mock/scenarios.yaml의 codes)과 같아야 한다\nunion(tables: [\n  base |> filter(fn: (r) => r.name == \"rrc_msg_id\" and r._value == 0.0) |> per_second(label: \"RRCSetupRequest\"),\n  base |> filter(fn: (r) => r.name == \"nas_msg_id\" and r._value == 86.0) |> per_second(label: \"AuthenticationRequest\"),\n  base |> filter(fn: (r) => r.name == \"nas_msg_id\" and (r._value == 89.0 or r._value == 68.0)) |> per_second(label: \"인증 실패·등록 거절\"),\n  base |> filter(fn: (r) => (r.name == \"ue_cipher_alg\" or r.name == \"ue_integrity_alg\") and r._value == 0.0) |> per_second(label: \"NEA0/NIA0로 바뀜\"),\n])\n  |> group(columns: [\"_field\"])"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "calcs": [
            "mean",
            "max"
          ],
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "axisLabel": "건/초",
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
